    "created_at": "2026-11-19T23:45:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-19T23:45:57Z",
    "body": "fix on issue/2012-equal-steps · PR #2842 · pinned by the_default_ladder_keeps_the_remainder_and_equal_steps_is_opt_in, equal_steps_keep_the_level_count_and_never_pass_the_stepdown, a_pocket_cuts_the_levels_of_its_mode, a_contour_cuts_the_levels_of_its_mode, the_project_file_writes_equal_steps_only_when_on_and_reads_it_back, mcp_edit_operation_reaches_equal_steps · merges at the next cut\n\nThe decision: the remainder ladder stays the default. Equal steps is an opt-in parameter, `links.approach.equal_steps`. The reasons are in `docs/decisions/2012-equal-steps.md`.\n\nFace, Trace, Engrave and Trochoidal Slot have no `links` object. They do not have the parameter in this PR. Issue #2832 adds it.\n\nThe quick gate had one red step, `ui suites: lib` (SIGSEGV after 3 s). The step was green when it ran again alone. The PR body has the details.\n",
